264	     * where {@code CITY3} is the upper-cased first three letters of the owner's city, {@code LAST3}
265	     * is the upper-cased first three letters of the owner's last name, and {@code NNNN} is a per-city
266	     * 4-digit zero-padded sequence equal to one more than the number of owners already in that city.
267	     * For example an owner named "Smithers" in "Springfield" created when 10 owners already live in
268	     * Springfield gets {@code 'SPR-SMI-0011'}.
